    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present to the market superb and stunning family home in the ever popular pocket of Knocklyon, No 13 Dalriada Park. This property is instantly appealing with an excellent standard of finish throughout and will be sure to appeal to all buyers searching for their dream home. It is flooded with natural light through the clever use of glazing while the living spaces are warm, inviting and spacious. Further benefits include large terrace to the front, contemporary kitchen, 3 bathrooms, (B) rating ber, generous room proportions, parking and a tasteful decor throughout. This property is ideally positioned within the development overlooking a large green space with mountain views. The accommodation briefly comprises entrance hallway, guest bathroom, living room and spacious kitchen / diner while upstairs there are three generous sized bedrooms (master ensuite) and family bathroom. . A communal garden with playground is easily accessed from the property. There is parking allocated with this property.Dalriada is a well-established and impeccably maintained estate and enjoys the best of both worlds, away from the hustle and bustle in a mature and peaceful setting with expansive views of the Dublin Mountains while still in close proximity to amenities and services. Excellent shopping facilities can be found at Dundrum, Rathfarnham, and Nutgrove shopping centres along with various neighbourhood shops nearby. Marley Park and St Enda's with their excellent recreational facilities and amenities are also located nearby. This property is also within the catchment area for St Colmcille's primary and secondary schools. There is ease of access to the M50 road network and public transport is well catered for with numerous Dublin Bus services travelling to the city centre. Early viewing highly recommended."
      },
